OL,3,GNEWSAWhat would you name a Lancashire
OL,4,Atrain?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail operator Avanti West Coast has
OL,7,Flaunched a competition to name one of
OL,8,Fits trains as part of Lancashire Day
OL,9,Fcelebrations.
OL,11,FThe company is inviting people to
OL,12,Fsuggest names that reflect Lancashire's
OL,13,Fhistory, culture, heritage or people.
OL,14,FThe winning entry will be chosen by a
OL,15,Fpanel from Avanti West Coast, BBC Radio
OL,16,FLancashire and Marketing Lancashire.
OL,18,FThe competition was launched during a
OL,19,Flive BBC Radio Lancashire Breakfast
OL,20,Fprogramme broadcast from Preston
OL,21,Frailway station ahead of Lancashire
OL,22,FDay.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
